# Scratch previews: GIFs, contact sheets, iteration. Regenerable and bulky, so
# ignored. The curated reference set lives in docs/images and IS committed --
# palette PNGs, a few tens of KB, regenerated by stage_sheet.py, model_descent.py
# and mockups.py.
preview/

# Downloaded 3D scan (~13 MB). Free but login-walled, so it cannot be fetched
# automatically anyway. CC BY 4.0, Fitzwilliam Museum GR.23.1850 -- see README.
mesh/

# Source photographs and the renders derived from them. Large, and the baked
# assets in firmware/ are what the build actually consumes.
# The source photograph is committed: at 1.1 MB it is small against the value of
# bake_assets and mockups running anywhere, which is what keeping it out cost.
image/*
!image/plato.png

